  "summary": "🚀 Front-End Developer | Technical Lead | UI/UX Enthusiast\n\nAs a Senior Software Developer (Frontend) at Finance of America, I design, build, and maintain enterprise-level, customer-facing websites that enhance digital engagement across business segments. I collaborate closely with design, product, and engineering teams to deliver performant, accessible, and SEO-optimized web experiences that educate, inspire, and convert.\n\nMy work spans front-end architecture, WordPress development, and interactive tools like calculators and configurators that improve user understanding and engagement. I’m passionate about crafting intuitive, high-impact interfaces and contributing to our Symphony design system to ensure visual and functional consistency across platforms.\n\nWith a background as a Creative Technical Lead at Wondros, I bring a strong foundation in team mentorship, scalable development practices, and cross-disciplinary collaboration. I believe in writing clean, purposeful code and creating accessible, responsive, and inclusive digital experiences that put people first.\n\nSpecialties: React, WordPress, JavaScript, HTML5, CSS3/SASS, PHP, Figma, WCAG/508 Accessibility, Performance Optimization, Git Workflows, Agile, Design Systems.",
